window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-096-a53f2af3d4ad3806.json"]={sha256:"a53f2af3d4ad3806c16a6c3865f00bc4ab6334bd732972ac88d8625d78bb7bb8",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-1063ce06de184aa6","url":"https://www.cs.uoregon.edu/research/tau/docs/newguide/re20.html","title":"TAU time correction","titleEn":"TAU time correction","publisher":"University of Oregon / TAU","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-096","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-096","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-097","referenceUrls":["https://perfetto.dev/docs/analysis/perfetto-sql-getting-started"],"title":"Perfetto：非同步區間聯集與量測窗口","titleEn":"Perfetto: asynchronous interval unions and observation windows","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：原始與衍生檔分開保存，無解反例仍可重現；不以漂亮時間線取代時鐘校準。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Raw and derived traces remain separate, the infeasible fixture is reproducible, and an orderly timeline does not substitute for clock calibration.","difference":"使用原創合成資料研究「Perfetto：非同步區間聯集與量測窗口」，從物理或資料契約推導計算，並以反例驗證。完成：交付slice.csv、裁切與合併中間表、ns→ms換算及十格核對圖；保留排除的不完整slice及其影響範圍。","differenceEn":"Investigate Perfetto: asynchronous interval unions and observation windows using an original synthetic fixture. Derive the calculation from its physical or data contract, challenge it with a counterexample, and defend a bounded conclusion. Complete: Deliver raw slices, clipping and merge intermediates, nanosecond conversion and the ten-cell check. Retain incomplete excluded slices and explain which portion of the conclusion they leave uncertain.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["將兩個前向條件寫成95+delta≥101與102+delta≥111，分別得到6與9；使用最大下界，而非平均兩個offset需求。","排序0、2、8的起點，逐筆延長目前聯集末端；畫出7到8的空白，再用duration總和11ms減重疊2ms交叉核對。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Write the forward constraints as 95 plus delta at least 101 and 102 plus delta at least 111. Derive bounds six and nine and explain why their maximum, rather than their average, satisfies both inequalities simultaneously.","Sort starts zero, two and eight and extend the current merged endpoint as intervals overlap. Mark the uncovered gap from seven to eight, then independently reconcile the eleven-millisecond duration sum with two milliseconds of overlap.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-006","referenceUrls":["https://apps.fz-juelich.de/jsc/hps/juwels/booster-overview.html"],"title":"JUWELS Booster：NUMA 分區的工作集偏斜","titleEn":"JUWELS Booster: imbalance across NUMA partitions","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：原始與衍生檔分開保存，無解反例仍可重現；不以漂亮時間線取代時鐘校準。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Raw and derived traces remain separate, the infeasible fixture is reproducible, and an orderly timeline does not substitute for clock calibration.","difference":"建立 array_id、bytes、home_domain 表，將一個陣列跨群的情形分成可核對的分片；不得重複計數共享陣列。","differenceEn":"Build an array_id, bytes and home_domain ledger. Represent a split array with explicit disjoint fragments, and deduplicate shared logical arrays before aggregating domain loads.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["將兩個前向條件寫成95+delta≥101與102+delta≥111，分別得到6與9；使用最大下界，而非平均兩個offset需求。","工作集偏斜定義為最大群負載除以八群平均負載；它是配置不均指標，不是總體效能降低比例；八群工作集為 [8,8,8,8,8,8,8,24] GiB；變更後各群 10 GiB，總量皆為 80 GiB；名義式 24/(80/8) = 2.4 skew ratio；變更式 10/(80/8) = 1 skew ratio。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Write the forward constraints as 95 plus delta at least 101 and 102 plus delta at least 111. Derive bounds six and nine and explain why their maximum, rather than their average, satisfies both inequalities simultaneously.","Define skew as maximum domain load divided by the mean over eight domains. This placement metric reveals imbalance but does not directly predict application slowdown or bandwidth loss. Record the synthetic working-set vector [8,8,8,8,8,8,8,24] GiB. Rebalance it to eight entries of 10 GiB while preserving the 80 GiB total and the same collection of logical arrays. Nominal 24/(80/8) = 2.4 skew ratio; changed 10/(80/8) = 1 skew ratio. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-9143501a5450e2f2","url":"https://perfetto.dev/docs/analysis/perfetto-sql-getting-started","title":"PerfettoSQL analysis","titleEn":"PerfettoSQL analysis","publisher":"Perfetto project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-ebc802d295f78722","url":"https://apps.fz-juelich.de/jsc/hps/juwels/booster-overview.html","title":"JUWELS Booster overview","titleEn":"JUWELS Booster overview","publisher":"Jülich Supercomputing Centre","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
